# DESCRIPTION

Section 8 holds what an administrator runs or configures: booting, the services that start the others, and the machine's devices.

The loader boots croi, the kernel, from UEFI, with the boot image, bootfs, beside it.
The kernel starts userboot, which starts launcher(8); the launcher starts every service bootfs's manifests name, and devmgr(8), one of them, starts the drivers.

